    description: "Source: deep-20260407-030917 prometheus reflect agent. Labels.Get exists in 3 prometheus files (model/labels/labels_dedupelabels.go, labels_stringlabels.go, labels_slicelabels.go), each guarded by mutually exclusive build tags (//go:build dedupelabels, stringlabels, default). Symbol ranker arbitrarily picks one as 'the' Labels.Get, hiding the alternates. A refactor must touch all three but only one is visible in centrality. Fix: detect //go:build directives in Go source, and when multiple definitions of the same fully-qualified symbol exist under mutually exclusive build constraints, emit a build_tag_alternative_of edge type linking them. This unifies the symbol's centrality and gives slice/explain a way to surface 'this symbol has 3 build-tag alternates'."  # 0ffd
    fields: {}  # 0ffd
